## 3. COST vs PRODUCT

| Cycle | Cost | Minutes | What it bought | Source |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 112 | $54.27 | 151 | B2 tooling, L2-B2a file, unrun | `cycle_runner.log:691` |
| 113 | $23.99 | 92 | L2-B2b file, unrun | `:706` |
